h “Safaranama – A Voice of Legendary Bollywood”, Padmashree Suresh Wadkar - an unforgettable evening dedicated to the timeless melodies that shaped generations of Indian cinema. This spectacular live concert in Phoenix, AZ promises to revive the golden era of Bollywood music through soulful performances, heartfelt tributes, and mesmerizing stage energy. Inspired by the legendary voices that defined romance, emotion, and celebration in Hindi cinema, the event brings together passionate performers and music lovers under one roof for a night filled with memories and melody.</div><div><br></div><div>From evergreen classics to emotionally rich ballads, the concert is designed to transport audiences back to the magical decades of Bollywood. Every song performed will celebrate the charm, elegance, and emotional depth of iconic Bollywood legends whose voices continue to inspire millions around the world. Whether you grew up listening to these songs or are discovering them for the first time, “Safaranama” offers a beautiful blend of nostalgia and live musical brilliance.</div>","group":null,"security":1,"tags":null,"status":1,"is_featured":0,"event_status":"Pending","meta_pixel_id":"2345432356749942","is_deleted":0,"created_at":"2026-07-13T10:25:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T14:03:23.000000Z","imagePath":"https://teptix.com/images/upload/","rate":0,"totalTickets":0,"soldTickets":502},"ticket":{"id":158,"event_id":54,"user_id":130,"SeatTable_id":null,"seatmap_id":null,"ticket_number":"IX-3471","name":"Row C","type":"paid","allday":1,"maximum_checkins":1,"quantity":30,"ticket_per_order":10,"start_time":"2026-08-09T00:00:00.000000Z","end_time":"2026-08-17T20:00:00.000000Z","price":"200.00","description":null,"status":1,"is_deleted":0,"is_add_on":0,"tax_id":"12","created_at":"2026-08-09T20:43:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T19:11:18.000000Z"}},{"id":2090341,"order_id":"#67986","customer_id":554,"guestuser_id":null,"organization_id":6,"event_id":3,"checkins_count":0,"