</span></font><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"627b4b62-5618-4012-bdcd-8426183db096\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-5\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\"><h2 data-section-id=\"1pbebei\" data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"179\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">🎬 BHAMARDO – Special Gujarati Movie Screening (With English Subtitles)<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></h2>

<p data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"385\"><strong data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"253\">The Event Palette proudly presents a Special Screening of <em data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"251\">BHAMARDO</em></strong> — a Gujarati film bringing a heartfelt story, memorable characters, and the spirit of Gujarati cinema to the big screen in Arizona!</p>

<p data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"513\">Join us with your <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"427\">family and friends</strong> for a special community movie experience and celebrate Gujarati cinema together. ❤️🎥</p>

<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"635\"><strong data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"547\">📅 Saturday, August 15, 2026</strong><br data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"550\">

<strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"565\">🕛 11:30 PM</strong><br data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"568\">

<strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"607\">📍 Pollack Cinemas – Tempe, Arizona</strong><br data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"610\">

<strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"635\">🎟 Tickets: Only $7*</strong></p>

<p data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"762\">Seats are limited, so <strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"686\">book your tickets early</strong> and enjoy <em data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"707\">BHAMARDO</em> on the big screen with the Arizona Gujarati community.</p>

<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"825\"><strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"825\">Gujarati Movie • Family Entertainment • Special Screening</strong></p>

<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"863\">Presented by<br data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"842\">

<strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"863\">The Event Palette</strong></p>

<p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"931\"><em data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"931\">Ticket price may be subject to applicable taxes, fees, or terms.</em></p>

<h3 data-section-id=\"l54frw\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"985\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">આ માત્ર વાર્તા નહીં, પણ દરેક ગુજરાતીના દિલના ધબકારાની વાત છે. </span></h3></div></div></div></div></div></div><font face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">ધૂળમાં વિતેલું બાળપણ અને આ અતૂટ દોસ્તીની આ સફર! ગુજરાતી સિનેમાનું ગૌરવ બનશે! 🌀✨ 

મનોરંજનનો 'ભમરડો' હવે જોરદાર ઘૂમશે! 

