    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>title</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"66 characters\">Holi Dhoom 2024: Get Ready to Paint Arizona with Colors and Music!</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>description</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"9529 characters\">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Are you ready to experience a burst of colors, music, and unmatched energy in the heart of Arizona? Holi Dhoom 2024 is here to light up your world! Presented by The Event Palette and Goshala, this vibrant Holi festival is set to take place in Arizona, promising an unforgettable celebration of love, joy, and culture. Get ready to immerse yourself in a sea of colors and dance to the beats of the sensational DJ AKHTAR, a Bollywood Celebrity DJ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot; id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-35213953-7fff-7e56-207f-62448b5e4110&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Unleash the Colors of Holi in Arizona&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Holi, the festival of colors, is celebrated with great enthusiasm in India and now, it&#039;s making its mark in Arizona too. Holi Dhoom 2024 is all about embracing the spirit of this joyous occasion and sharing the love. Whether you&#039;re a part of the Indian diaspora, a culture enthusiast, or just someone looking to experience something unique, this event is for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Meet DJ AKHTAR: The Bollywood Celebrity DJ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Get ready to groove to the electrifying tunes spun by DJ AKHTAR, a Bollywood Celebrity DJ known for setting the dance floor on fire. With a repertoire of Bollywood hits and chart-toppers, DJ AKHTAR is all set to make Holi Dhoom 2024 a night to remember. Get ready for an incredible musical journey through the vibrant sounds of India!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.ibb.co/52D8Rsd/Untitled-design-14.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width: 400px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Presented by The Event Palette &amp;amp; Goshala&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Holi Dhoom 2024 is brought to you by two powerhouses in the event industry - The Event Palette and Goshala. Their expertise in creating memorable experiences is second to none. With their combined resources and creativity, you can expect nothing less than a spectacular Holi event.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.ibb.co/GJsPzHw/Goshala.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width: 638px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The Highlights of Holi Dhoom 2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Color Play: Immerse yourself in a riot of colors as you throw powdered gulal at your friends and dance to the beats of DJ AKHTAR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Live Performances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;: Besides DJ AKHTAR, there will be live performances showcasing the rich cultural heritage of India, including traditional music and dance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mouthwatering Cuisine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;: Indulge in delectable Indian cuisine with a variety of street food stalls and authentic dishes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Family-Friendly Fun&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;: Holi Dhoom 2024 is a family-friendly event with activities for all ages, including face painting, henna tattoos, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Ethnic Bazaar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;: Shop for colorful clothing, jewelry, and handicrafts at the Ethnic Bazaar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Get Your Tickets Now!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Don&#039;t miss out on this incredible celebration of Holi in Arizona. Grab your tickets now and be a part of Holi Dhoom 2024, where colors, music, and culture collide in a burst of festive fun! It&#039;s a hype you won&#039;t want to miss!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;This Holi, let&#039;s come together to create a kaleidoscope of joy, love, and togetherness. See you at Holi Dhoom 2024! &#127752;&#127881;&#127926;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</span>\"
