      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1517 characters\">&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1h4bcr0&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;39&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1517 characters\">&lt;p data-start=&quot;41&quot; data-end=&quot;106&quot;&gt;Phoenix, get ready for the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;106&quot;&gt;BIGGEST DANDIYA NIGHT of the year!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1517 characters\">&lt;p data-start=&quot;108&quot; data-end=&quot;332&quot;&gt;Experience an unforgettable evening of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;147&quot; data-end=&quot;214&quot;&gt;nonstop Dandiya, Garba, music, culture, colors, and celebration&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;255&quot;&gt;PURVASTIC &#8211; Navratri Garba Nights&lt;/strong&gt;, the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;261&quot; data-end=&quot;332&quot;&gt;biggest and only dedicated Dandiya Night event in Phoenix, Arizona.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1517 characters\">&lt;p data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot;&gt;The beats will be bigger. The energy will be higher. And the Dandiya will be nonstop.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
