 spirit of Gujarati cinema to the big screen in Arizona!</p><p data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"513\">Join us with your <span data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"427\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">family and friends</span> for a special community movie experience and celebrate Gujarati cinema together. ❤️🎥</p><p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"635\"><span data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"547\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">📅 Saturday, August 15, 2026</span><br data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"550\"><span data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"565\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">🕛 11:30 PM</span><br data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"568\"><span data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"607\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">📍 Pollack Cinemas – Tempe, Arizona</span><br data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"610\"><span data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"635\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">🎟 Tickets: Only $7*</span></p><p data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"762\">Seats are limited, so <span data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"686\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">book your tickets early</span> and enjoy <em data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"707\">BHAMARDO</em> on the big screen with the Arizona Gujarati community.</p><p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"825\"><span data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"825\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Gujarati Movie • Family Entertainment • Special Screening</span></p><p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"863\">Presented by<br data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"842\"><span data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"863\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">The Event Palette</span></p><p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"931\"><em data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"931\">Ticket price may be subject to applicable taxes, fees, or terms.</em></p><h3 data-section-id=\"l54frw\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"985\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">આ માત્ર વાર્તા નહીં, પણ દરેક ગુજરાતીના દિલના ધબકારાની વાત છે. </span><