      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"645 characters\">Phoenix, get ready for the BIGGEST DANDIYA NIGHT of the year!<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"645 characters\">Experience an unforgettable evening of nonstop Dandiya, Garba, music, culture, colors, and celebration at PURVASTIC &#8211; Navratri Garba Nights, the biggest and only dedicated Dandiya Night event in Phoenix, Arizona.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
