    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>description</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"645 characters\">Phoenix, get ready for the BIGGEST DANDIYA NIGHT of the year!<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"645 characters\">Experience an unforgettable evening of nonstop Dandiya, Garba, music, culture, colors, and celebration at PURVASTIC &#8211; Navratri Garba Nights, the biggest and only dedicated Dandiya Night event in Phoenix, Arizona.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"645 characters\">The beats will be bigger. The energy will be higher. And the Dandiya will be nonstop.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"645 characters\">Bring your friends, dress in your finest traditional attire, grab your Dandiya sticks, and get ready to celebrate Navratri like never before.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"645 characters\">3rd October 2026 | Gates Open 7 PM<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
